; Paradigm: AI-First Machine Code Generation & Direct Hardware Execution
; Zero Structural / RAW / WAW Hazards — Fully Pipelined VLIW Schedule
; ============================================================================
; Bundle Format: B<cycle>: <slot0> <slot1> <slot2> <slot3>
