; ============================================================================

; Cycle 0: Silicon Hardware Initialization, Memory Binding & Sentry Watchdog
B0000: _RS00$000> _SH00$000> '=01#000A> '=02#0014>

; Cycle 1: Optical QK^T GEMM (Brain 2), Tile Transpose & Synaptic Plasticity Setup
B0001: _OP04$100> _TT03$200> _ST0C$084> _NO00$000>

; Cycle 2: Sub-Byte Ternary Dot (Brain 2), Forward Autodiff Tap & CORDIC Trig
B0002: _MD05.400> _FA07$400> _CD09$200> _NO00$000>

; Cycle 3: ALU SIMD Sum, Cross-Attention Gating, 256-Core Chip Barrier & DVFS Eco
B0003: _PO06+503> _CA08$402> _bb00$000> _EE00$000>

; Cycle 4: 4D Wormhole Tunnel, LIF Neuron Step & Photonic Laser Pump Strobe
B0004: _WH0A$600> _LI0B$705> _1100$000> _NO00$000>

; Cycle 5: Reversible Fredkin Swap Gate (Brain 3)
B0005: _RF06$300> _NO00$000> _NO00$000> _NO00$000>

; Cycle 6: Spatial Broadcast Across 4D Torus Mesh & Graceful Silicon Halt
B0006: _SB06$000> _NO00$000> _NO00$000> _HL00$000>
